 backend availability detection with a clear install hint, disabled
 Run button when absent, and README install notes (Ookla speedtest is
 not in the Ubuntu archives: snap or Ookla's apt repo).
 .
 v2.5.7 adds: setup.sh UFW step only adds SSH/HTTP/WireGuard rules when no
 matching rule exists — re-runs no longer re-open a deliberately removed
 WAN-wide rule (e.g. global port 80).
